# A genuine circular dependency between feeder and kafka specifically (crdb isn't part of the cycle yet,
# since its tfvars hasn't been given feeder_network_name yet).
# The way to break a peering cycle like this is to defer one side's peering by one apply cycle. 

# Here's the sequence:
# Temporarily blank both peering targets in python-feeder/terraform_infra/terraform.tfvars
crdb_network_name  = "CHANGE_ME"
kafka_network_name = "CHANGE_ME"
